  "id": "pay-equity",
  "term": "pay equity",
  "definition": "Pay equity is the idea that fairness in pay reflects social behavior and attitudes about gender. In this source, it is described as closely connected with gender attitudes, cultural values, and efforts to reduce discriminatory beliefs and prejudice in employment.",
